{"4954110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fifth Sun: New Fire", "steam_appid": 4954110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fifth Sun is dying.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a cooperative survival world inspired by Mesoamerican mythology. Hunt, gather, build, and grow powerful enough to confront the creatures and forgotten gods that stand between humanity and the next dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or bring friends into a hostile wilderness where every expedition serves a larger purpose: strengthen your settlement, survive the turning calendar, and gather the sacrifices needed to reignite the Fifth Sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/196b7d699d2f42abf7af3c92516697f2.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/196b7d699d2f42abf7af3c92516697f2.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/196b7d699d2f42abf7af3c92516697f2.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the wilderness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with little more than your hands and your instincts. Track animals through dense grasslands and jungle, gather wood, stone, food, and rare materials, then cook what you hunt and prepare for the dangers beyond your firelight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife with spears and other crafted weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook food and manage the needs of survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated wilderness, landmarks, caves, and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight predators and mythological enemies with readable, skill-based combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/e2d39557986f9e983e74dffe2c67845a.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/e2d39557986f9e983e74dffe2c67845a.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/e2d39557986f9e983e74dffe2c67845a.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a home worth defending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a small camp into a fortified player settlement. Build with wood and stone, raise walls, towers, houses, lakeside structures, and monumental temples. Your home is more than decoration: it is the base from which every hunt, expedition, and ritual begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/bccdaefa3989a60517662a4a38c78404.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/bccdaefa3989a60517662a4a38c78404.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/bccdaefa3989a60517662a4a38c78404.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awaken the beast within</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft increasingly powerful equipment, develop perks and abilities, and shape your character for the challenges ahead. Hunt as a coordinated group, combine powers, and push deeper into each world's progression before the calendar runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/7ba6c5c90cacee404a7ea00d0fa98fe0.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/7ba6c5c90cacee404a7ea00d0fa98fe0.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/7ba6c5c90cacee404a7ea00d0fa98fe0.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into forgotten places</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient entrances hidden across the landscape. Explore dangerous dungeons, solve environmental mechanisms, recover valuable resources, and uncover the path toward each world's guardian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/04d1f173a132cba0f0bfa114d850765e.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/04d1f173a132cba0f0bfa114d850765e.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/04d1f173a132cba0f0bfa114d850765e.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do not face the old gods alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifth Sun supports both solo play and online co-op. Divide the work at home, hunt together in the wilds, and rally your group for multi-phase boss encounters built around telegraphed attacks, changing hazards, and escalating phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/8f7849fc4183a491907e6e941f2e4cb8.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/8f7849fc4183a491907e6e941f2e4cb8.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/8f7849fc4183a491907e6e941f2e4cb8.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the Fifth Sun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters of a dying age and carry their power to the grand altar. Complete the New Fire Ceremony, open the way into the Dead Suns, and continue the struggle across distinct mythic worlds with their own atmosphere, creatures, dungeons, and gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/ca2788a6abf87dccf1fa5dd9f7b8f517.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/ca2788a6abf87dccf1fa5dd9f7b8f517.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/ca2788a6abf87dccf1fa5dd9f7b8f517.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fifth Sun is dying.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a cooperative survival world inspired by Mesoamerican mythology. Hunt, gather, build, and grow powerful enough to confront the creatures and forgotten gods that stand between humanity and the next dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or bring friends into a hostile wilderness where every expedition serves a larger purpose: strengthen your settlement, survive the turning calendar, and gather the sacrifices needed to reignite the Fifth Sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/196b7d699d2f42abf7af3c92516697f2.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/196b7d699d2f42abf7af3c92516697f2.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/196b7d699d2f42abf7af3c92516697f2.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the wilderness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with little more than your hands and your instincts. Track animals through dense grasslands and jungle, gather wood, stone, food, and rare materials, then cook what you hunt and prepare for the dangers beyond your firelight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife with spears and other crafted weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook food and manage the needs of survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated wilderness, landmarks, caves, and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight predators and mythological enemies with readable, skill-based combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/e2d39557986f9e983e74dffe2c67845a.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/e2d39557986f9e983e74dffe2c67845a.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/e2d39557986f9e983e74dffe2c67845a.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a home worth defending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a small camp into a fortified player settlement. Build with wood and stone, raise walls, towers, houses, lakeside structures, and monumental temples. Your home is more than decoration: it is the base from which every hunt, expedition, and ritual begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/bccdaefa3989a60517662a4a38c78404.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/bccdaefa3989a60517662a4a38c78404.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/bccdaefa3989a60517662a4a38c78404.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awaken the beast within</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft increasingly powerful equipment, develop perks and abilities, and shape your character for the challenges ahead. Hunt as a coordinated group, combine powers, and push deeper into each world's progression before the calendar runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/7ba6c5c90cacee404a7ea00d0fa98fe0.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/7ba6c5c90cacee404a7ea00d0fa98fe0.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/7ba6c5c90cacee404a7ea00d0fa98fe0.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend into forgotten places</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient entrances hidden across the landscape. Explore dangerous dungeons, solve environmental mechanisms, recover valuable resources, and uncover the path toward each world's guardian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/04d1f173a132cba0f0bfa114d850765e.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/04d1f173a132cba0f0bfa114d850765e.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/04d1f173a132cba0f0bfa114d850765e.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do not face the old gods alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifth Sun supports both solo play and online co-op. Divide the work at home, hunt together in the wilds, and rally your group for multi-phase boss encounters built around telegraphed attacks, changing hazards, and escalating phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/8f7849fc4183a491907e6e941f2e4cb8.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/8f7849fc4183a491907e6e941f2e4cb8.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/8f7849fc4183a491907e6e941f2e4cb8.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the Fifth Sun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters of a dying age and carry their power to the grand altar. Complete the New Fire Ceremony, open the way into the Dead Suns, and continue the struggle across distinct mythic worlds with their own atmosphere, creatures, dungeons, and gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/ca2788a6abf87dccf1fa5dd9f7b8f517.poster.avif?t=1788197006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/ca2788a6abf87dccf1fa5dd9f7b8f517.webm?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954110/extras/ca2788a6abf87dccf1fa5dd9f7b8f517.mp4?t=1788197006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Survive the world of Mesoamerican mythology - alone or with friends. Gather, build, and survive your way through hostile wilds. Raid dungeons, appease the gods, and slay their monsters to offer them as sacrifices at the grand altar to reignite the Fifth Sun and open the gateway to the past suns.", "supported_languages":